ADDITIONAL NOTICE

PdfShred extracts and copies text from PDF files you already have, including
files whose viewers honor a "do not copy" permission flag. Those flags are
viewer hints, not encryption. Password-protected PDFs still require the
password; this tool does not crack passwords or commercial ebook DRM.

You are responsible for having the legal right to copy, edit, and save the
documents you open. The author is not liable for copyright infringement,
data loss, or misuse.
